@ Index:   Problem 8, solves rate, near-unity ratio
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ N 32, PV -999999, PMT 0, FV 1000000, one period a year. Solves I%/a.
LBL ‘P8’
  32
  STO ‘NPPER’
  0
  STO ‘I%/a’
  -999999
  STO ‘PV’
  0
  STO ‘PMT’
  1.e+6
  STO ‘FV’
  1
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  ENDP
  I/a
  END
